<title>HONG KONG: BADMINTON-HONG KONG OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-HONG KONG OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>Hong Kong Open badminton tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>5/8 Budi Santoso (Indonesia) beat 9/16 Deepankar Bhattacharjee</p>
<p>(India) 15-7 17-8</p>
<p>3/4 Fung Permadi (Taiwan) beat 5/8 Soren B. Nielson (Denmark)</p>
<p>15-6 15-7</p>
<p>9/16 Salim (Indonesia) beat Wong Choong Hann (Malaysia) 15-3</p>
<p>15-3</p>
<p>3/4 Thomas Stuer-Laurisden (Denmark) beat Indra Wijaya</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 15-10 16-18 15-12</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>1-Mia Audina (Indonesia) beat 5/8-Lee Joo-hyun (South Korea)</p>
<p>11-6 11-1</p>
<p>3/4-Kim Ji-hyun (South Korea) beat 5/8-Brenda Beenhakker</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 11-4 11-5</p>
<p>5/8-Ra Kyung-min (South Korea) beat 3/4-Meiluawaty (Indonesia)</p>
<p>11-1 11-7</p>
<p>2-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat 3/4-Cindana (Indonesia) 11-2</p>
<p>11-2</p>
</text>
